Main Classes - part 1 
University Food Ordering & Managment System


1.User
Attributes: userID, name, email, password
Methods: login(), logout(), displayInfo()
Responsibility: Stores general user information & manages user login.

2.Student
Attributes: studentID, balance
Methods: browseFood(), placeOrder(), viewOrders()
Responsibility: Allows students to browse menus & order food.

3.Admin
Attributes: adminID, accessLevel
Methods: addFoodItem(), removeFoodItem(), updateFoodItem()
Responsibility: Manages cafeteria food items & orders.
4.Fooditem
Attributes: itemID, itemName, price, category, availability
Methods: displayItem(), updatePrice(), checkAvailability()
Responsibility: Stores & manages information about available food.

